   "title": "Present perfect: experience, result, for / since",
   "subtitle": "Linking the past and the present",
   "goals": [
    "Use the present perfect for **experiences**, **results** and **unfinished time**.",
    "Choose **for** (duration) or **since** (starting point).",
    "Contrast it with the past simple."
